tellraw @a {"translate":"%1$s has found the hidden advancement %2$s%3$s%4$s","with":[{"selector":"@s"},{"color":"light_purple","text":"["},{"color":"light_purple","translate":"CaseOh's Unbalanced Diet","hover_event":{"action":"show_text","value":{"color":"light_purple","translate":"CaseOh's Unbalanced Diet","extra":[{"text":"\n"},{"color":"#DE4ADC","translate":"The task at hand is to partake of 400 portions of each victual within the game, Thereafter, thou must needs repair to the gymnasium, for thy weight shall have swollen to nigh upon 1000 pounds. Thou seekest 4000 spider eyes, for no other reason than Yes, and the number is doubled should the item be compostable, consumable with a full belly, granteth the hunger effect, or be dried kelp. Furthermore, if it be a plantable item, the number is multiplied by four. As for cake, seven slices, being a whole cake, shall count as one of its 800 required consumptions.\n\nSuggested by Zintux"},{"text":"\n\n"},{"color":"gray","italic":true,"translate":"%1$s tab","with":[{"translate":"Husbandry"}]}]}}},{"color":"light_purple","text":"]"}]}